{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/37","id":4659336522,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABFbfVSg","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/37","diff_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/37.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/37.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/37","number":37,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"core: elastic expert cache via CUDA VMM and on-demand GPU vision lifecycle","user":{"login":"code-martin","id":44068401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin","html_url":"https://github.com/code-martin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\nThis PR implements elastic resizing for the MoE expert cache using the CUDA Virtual Memory Management (VMM) API and introduces an on-demand lifecycle for GPU Vision models.\n\n### Key Changes\n- **CUDA VMM Elastic Expert Cache**:\n  - Replaces fixed monolithic cudaMalloc allocations with cuMemAddressReserve, cuMemCreate, and cuMemMap / cuMemSetAccess.\n  - Supports dynamic online shrink (RESIZE) and expansion (GROW) without reallocating virtual addresses or invalidating captured CUDA graphs.\n  - Automatically falls back to standard cudaMalloc if VMM is unsupported on older architectures.\n- **On-Demand GPU Vision Lifecycle**:\n  - Vision encoder is dynamically loaded into VRAM only when image embeddings are required.\n  - Temporarily shrinks the expert cache to release VRAM, performs vision encoding, offloads the vision model, and instantly grows the expert cache back to full capacity.\n  - Reclaims over 600 MoE slots (~830 MB) of VRAM permanently during text-only generation.\n- **Client Validation Tool**:\n  - Adds \tools/test_vision_client.py for end-to-end verification of image encoding, VRAM contraction, and cache restoration.\n\n### Testing\n- Verified on Windows with MSVC C++20 and CUDA 12.6 (RTX 3080 10GB).\n- Text-only generation runs with 2,459 expert slots (up from 1,840). Vision requests encode in ~7.5s and immediately restore the full 2,459 cache slots.","created_at":"2026-09-28T04:41:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T14:54:29Z","closed_at":"2026-09-28T14:54:29Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"43c919f1761f448008c5f997c12dcbba9436049f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/37/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/37/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/37/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/statuses/5b513598747f7fcc129f67b6bc7e2d7e09596c04","head":{"label":"code-martin:feature/vmm-elastic-cache-and-vision","ref":"feature/vmm-elastic-cache-and-vision","sha":"5b513598747f7fcc129f67b6bc7e2d7e09596c04","user":{"login":"code-martin","id":44068401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-martin","html